+# U2.38AU11I USB Record Exit Monitor Fix
+
+Marcadores de esta versión:
+
+- U2_38AU11I_SPLIT_USB_PROFILE_FIRST_A_FIX
+- AU11I_FIRST_MODAL_COLD_SAFE
+- AU11I_USB_RECORD_EXIT_MONITOR_FIX
+- AU11I_SCPI_R_USB_RECORD_SHORTCUT
+- AU11I_NO_SYNC_SD_MIRROR_ON_MONITOR_TOGGLE
+
+Atajos:
+
+- Instrument + R1+RIGHT: abrir USB-C RECORD / SCPI-R.
+- USB-C RECORD + R1+LEFT: cerrar y volver a Instrument.
